   "lines": [
    "At 7 am was down",
    "on the Russia to",
    "see Annie Murray,",
    "whom I found",
    "very sweet and",
    "pretty and a little",
    "wee bit out of",
    "temper.",
    "Took Aunt Susie",
    "out to Oyster Bay",
    "Elliott and I",
    "in his 21 foot sail-",
    "-boat the Daphné,",
    "started out at 9.30^p.m^,",
    "with a light but",
    "steady southerly wind,",
    "and cast anchor in",
    "Rye Harbour at 1.30^a.m^"
   ],
